<title>USA: Hemagen Diagnostics says COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Hemagen Diagnostics says COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, MASS. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hemagen Diagnostics Inc said its chief operating officer, Peter von Stein, resigned from the company to pursue another opportunity.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment further. It provided no further details.</p>
<p>The company, which makes diagnostic test kits used to measure the constituents in human blood, said von Stein will become an executive at Elan Pharma Inc's HiChem unit.</p>
